DieBack - A simple Earthbound style background maker 

Links:
-Itch.io https://okano.itch.io/dieback
-GitHub: https://github.com/Okanoa/Dieback

Pros:
-Open source
-Free
-Great for making trippy moving backgrounds
-Contains Lua scripting and .PCX fileformat
-Basic/decently easy to use

Cons:
-No longer being updated
-Little to no documentation except a discord support server
-Only supports Windows x64
-Poor GIF exports (Creator recommends screen recording)
